•	When you create project intercompany customer invoices, you can choose Both, Invoices, or Credit notes to control whether charges and credits are processed together or separately.&lt;br&gt;
•	Transaction date and tran (GA: March CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Project Operations

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Portfolio planning is an AI-first capability in Sales Research Agent that turns CRM data, lakehouse signals (such as budgets, targets, usage, billing, and adoption), and web context into a continuously updated plan across accounts, segments, and partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What's new&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p (GA: March CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Sales

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;When you enable the &lt;strong&gt;Enable Handling of Multiple Eliminations in Investment Projects&lt;/strong&gt; setting, you activate this feature.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multiple eliminations&lt;/strong&gt;: The system lets you configure project groups to allow you to eliminate the investment project multiple time (GA: August CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Project Operations

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;The following controls for canvas apps are reaching general availability:&lt;br&gt;
•	Card gallery&lt;br&gt;
•	Persona&lt;br&gt;
•	Avatar group&lt;br&gt;
•	Metrics card&lt;br&gt;
These controls provide reusable patterns for responsive record cards, individual and grouped identities, and key metrics. Makers supply data, presen (GA: January CY2027) — Power Apps

[DATE_CHANGED] &lt;p&gt;We’re expanding form fill assistance in model-driven applications in Power Apps to support lookup, rich text, and multi-select choice fields, helping users complete more of their forms with AI-powered suggestions and less manual entry.&lt;/p&gt;
